  <h2>The Swearing Project</h2>
  <p>I just published <a href="https://theswearingproject.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Swearing Project</a> — a $12 PDF guide on how to find The Magic Pause. Based on a personal experiment that changed how I react to everything.</p>

  <h2>Spike</h2>
  <p>Taking on new done-for-you email marketing clients. This is year 22 at <a href="https://spike.co.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">spike.co.nz</a>.</p>

  <h2>Racer Products</h2>
  <p>I'm Head of Marketing at Racer Products. My role covers our three main brands: <a href="https://racerproducts.co.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">racerproducts.co.nz</a>, <a href="https://scarles.co.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">scarles.co.nz</a> and <a href="https://mudstuck.co.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mudstuck.co.nz</a>.</p>

  <h2>The Book</h2>
  <p>The book I co-wrote with best-selling author and Psychology Coach Charles Donoghue, <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=light+your+own+fire+donoghue+edley" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Light Your Own Fire</a>, is published. Alison Rowe — winner of both the Boston Marathon and New York City Marathon in the same year — wrote the endorsement.</p>

  <h2>Writing</h2>
  <p>I've been kickstarting people's thinking with the <a href="/mondaymotivator/">MondayMotivator</a> since 2004.</p>

